You're referring to the level immediately below the castle.  It was
full of undead in three graveyards and has a temple to Moloch on the
left side?  This is called the Valley of the Dead, and is not
technically part of Gehennom.  There is a way down in the upper left
corner of that level.  You will have to search for hidden doors to
find the way to get there.

